lisa-design:
- Provider interface exactly as contracts.md; supporting types reuse v1alpha1 (ObjectRef, Link, Actor, EffectOp, GroupSource, Scope, SecretRef); refinements recorded in contracts.md.
- Credential redacts its token in every output path (fmt verbs, slog, JSON); the API server copies fields into the generated type explicitly.
- Duplicate deliveries: sink returns ErrDuplicateDelivery; handler 202 ok / 200 duplicate / 503 other; deliveries recorded only after Accept returns.
- Rebuild = List → Observe → Observation.Projections (marker parsing stays in the adapter); GroupLookup injected into adapter constructors (Connect unchanged).
- Registry is not global; the fake registers as github and keeps one Conn per instance across reconnects; its Apply mutates objects so cascades observe effects.
- Open for GH-S1-T01: the lease's single gitCredential has no slot for the separate read-only token (additive API change).
